:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="dolx-changelog">
		<div class="dolx-changelog-hero">
			<span class="dolx-changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>v0.20.20</span></h1>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="dolx-changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Updated to vanilla 0.5.12.7</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added the X-Change Beta pill and full dual-womb support</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>X-Change Beta gives a vaginal body two separate wombs.</li>
		<li>Each womb can conceive, progress through pregnancy, and give birth independently, including pregnancies with different due dates or fathers.</li>
		<li>Both wombs are shown separately as <strong>Left womb</strong> and <strong>Right womb</strong> in Characteristics and the mirror.</li>
		<li>A second pregnancy becomes less likely as the first progresses, while fertility boosters and <strong>Hyper Fertility</strong> can raise the chance again.</li>
		<li>Parasites can occupy a free womb and block conception there until removed.</li>
		<li>Pregnancy cheats now work on each womb separately, including impregnation, stored loads, forced conception, and clearing pregnancies.</li>
		<li>Both pregnancies contribute to belly and breast growth.</li>
		<li>Giving birth from one womb no longer ends the other pregnancy or starts recovery too early.</li>
		<li>Eggs and live pregnancies can exist at the same time, and each womb can lay its eggs separately.</li>
		<li>Losing the Beta effect does not end existing pregnancies.</li>
		<li>Available as <strong>X-Change Beta (gray)</strong> and <strong>X-Change Pink Beta</strong> on the black market and as a possible nonconsensual spike.</li>
		<li><strong>SWP Anti-beta Pill</strong> removes the Beta marker.</li>
		<li>Fixed the wrong baby species being used during labour when both wombs carry different litters.</li>
		<li>Fixed cheats and the museum ward allowing conception in a womb already occupied by parasites.</li>
		<li>Also fixed two X-Change settings missing from settings export.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added new Alpha, Beta, and Omega settings</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added four options under <strong>X-Change Settings &gt; Alpha/Beta/Omega</strong>.</li>
		<li><strong>Omega only affects the ass without a vagina</strong> <em>(off by default)</em>: Omega uses the ass only when the player has no vagina. Cravings, creampie effects, heat bonuses, and warnings follow the same hole.</li>
		<li><strong>Alpha grows you a cock</strong> <em>(off by default)</em>: Alpha can temporarily grow a cock when the player does not already have one. It disappears when the effect ends.</li>
		<li><strong>Alpha and Omega cause rut and heat</strong> <em>(on by default)</em>: Alpha causes rut and Omega causes heat without first requiring breeding denial buildup.</li>
		<li><strong>Alpha, Beta and Omega increase allure</strong> <em>(on by default)</em>: all three increase Allure while active.</li>
		<li>Updated Alpha and Omega trait descriptions and added a Beta trait entry.</li>
		<li>Fixed the <strong>X-Change Settings</strong> tab appearing empty when starting a new game.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded fishing with tackle, bait fish, and POCKET support</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Fishing now has separate <strong>rods and reels</strong>, selected before casting.</li>
		<li>Rods affect fish fatigue and strain, while reels affect line gain and loss during Reel, Hold, and Slack.</li>
		<li>Added Black, Silver, Gold, and Bone tackle. Bone is a risky sidegrade found while fishing at night after enough experience.</li>
		<li>Silver and Gold tackle unlock through fishing progress and bait-shop requests.</li>
		<li>Rods and reels do not use POCKET slots.</li>
		<li>Added a permanent <strong>Can of Worms</strong> that can hold up to 20 worms and uses one POCKET slot whether full or empty.</li>
		<li>Added small bass, small carp, small herring, and small trout as bait fish.</li>
		<li>Bait fish shift catch chances toward suitable larger fish and are required for some catches such as cod, pike, and eel.</li>
		<li>Each bait-fish type uses one POCKET slot regardless of quantity.</li>
		<li>Replaced the old generic baitfish with <strong>Sardine</strong>, a normal sea fish that can be caught, sold, and eaten but no longer used as bait.</li>
		<li>Fish, bait fish, and worms can be eaten directly where appropriate.</li>
		<li>Cat, fox, bird, bear, and Water Dragon transformations can swallow suitable catches whole.</li>
		<li>The Journal now tracks bait fish separately from ordinary fish.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated VVIP Spa tipping</strong>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Leave a gratuity</strong> now opens six selectable tip amounts matching the orphanage pattern.</li>
		<li>Every tip amount grants Kindness fame.</li>
		<li>The sexual option is now separately labelled <strong>Proposition the masseur privately</strong>.</li>
		<li>A nonviolent intimate encounter allows an additional gratuity afterward.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Avery's mansion garden</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>If the player has not planted anything and Avery notices, Avery can ask to plant the garden together.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Whitney now appears at the window more often</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>The wild night still happens at most once per week.</li>
		<li>Its chance is now about 80%, and the first event can happen sooner.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Restored old hairstyles as modded hairstyles</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Some removed hairstyles have been brought back as modded hair options.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Restored colour preset deletion</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Clothing colour presets can be deleted again.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Tweaks and Rebalancing</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Updated Innocence</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Innocence no longer unlocks masturbation through its exhibitionism/deviancy obliviousness bonus because the character is too naive to know how to do it.</li>
		<li>Very high Arousal can still unlock masturbation outside the temple.</li>
		<li>Blackmail quest stage 4 can still bypass the restriction.</li>
		<li>Temple masturbation remains blocked by Innocence even at high Arousal.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Improved Critter Magnet</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Critter sex now correctly reduces positive Stress and Trauma gains by 75%, including effects using custom multipliers.</li>
		<li>Added missing Critter Magnet support for swarm penetration and relevant struggle-anatomy interactions.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated passive Arousal during menstrual cycles</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Passive Arousal now rises naturally only during risky or dangerous fertility stages.</li>
		<li>It fades normally during safer stages.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Improved Water Dragon egg laying</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Water Dragon laying now behaves more like hawk laying, but with fewer and much larger eggs and a stronger focus on the nest.</li>
		<li>Fertilised bird eggs carried by a full Water Dragon are now laid in the nest instead of using the harpy bed scene.</li>
		<li>Laying causes Pain, Arousal, and Fatigue based on egg count and can trigger orgasm at high Arousal.</li>
		<li>Resting in the hollow afterward reduces Trauma and Stress.</li>
		<li>Water Dragons usually lay one egg, sometimes two, and rarely three.</li>
		<li><strong>Accelerated Brood Cycle</strong> shortens the delay and increases the chance of laying more eggs.</li>
		<li>Staying away from the nest too long can force laying wherever the player sleeps, with greater Pain and distress and plain shells instead of pastel ones.</li>
		<li>Omega characters carrying eggs anally now use the correct hole during laying scenes.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded DoLP speech attitudes and narration</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Expanded attitude speech across six files.</li>
		<li>Updated narration to reduce ambiguous wording and sentence structure.</li>
		<li>Avery encounter speech now adapts to additional DoLP attitudes.</li>
		<li>Bailey's brat-style handling now also applies to Cruel attitude where appropriate.</li>
		<li>Fixed Morgan's malformed <code>&lt;&lt;he&gt;&gt;</code> macro.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Reworked Depths Asylum writing</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Revised ambiguous sequencing, sentences, and wording.</li>
		<li>Expanded speech-attitude support throughout the area.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Attempted to reduce lag in mirror hair selection</strong>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Fixes and Improvements</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Fixed repeat bag eating, Water Dragon save loading, and Gwylan shop exits</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed lube taking up bag space</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed stale combat hand targets</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Prevented stale genital-holding states from breaking combat action menus, including the Residential Dog encounter.</li>
		<li>Valid one-handed and two-handed holds are preserved.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Water Dragon nest wake-up routing</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Sleeping in the nest now explicitly triggers the nest-specific egg-laying reaction and links directly to <strong>Prepare the nest</strong>.</li>
		<li>Water Dragon pregnancy labour inside the nest now has unique prose and routes directly to the hollow instead of sending the player outside.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Pregnancy and Water Dragon edge cases</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Water Dragon egg laying no longer interrupts named NPC scenes, combat, or possession and instead waits until the next safe sleep.</li>
		<li>Beta pregnancy correctly lowers the chance of conception in the second womb as the first pregnancy progresses.</li>
		<li><strong>Hyper Fertility</strong> and other fertility boosts can still raise that chance.</li>
		<li>Morning-after pills can remove a pending second Beta conception even when the first womb already has an established pregnancy.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Project Pelagos event flow</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Consecutive Harper passages now replace Harper's previous event record instead of creating duplicate slot-0 entries.</li>
		<li>Returning to the lab, corridor, brooding chamber, or egg-laying flow clears stale NPC and event state.</li>
		<li>The debugger label now refreshes after passage rendering so genuine failures visibly become red <strong>EVENT DESYNC</strong>.</li>
		<li>The event overlay recalculates its status when opened instead of using stale sidebar state.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed encounters getting stuck or lasting too long</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>NPC Pleasure no longer decreases unexpectedly and block orgasm progression, especially during oral encounters.</li>
		<li>The Ivory Wraith no longer repeatedly tries to overwrite a tattoo it cannot replace.</li>
		<li>NPCs now change or escalate actions when an encounter stalls instead of repeating harmless actions, pens, or makeup indefinitely.</li>
		<li>NPC Rage gradually decreases after reaching maximum, preventing endless encounters when an apology window is missed.</li>
		<li>Beasts no longer become permanently stuck between the player's thighs after the legs close.</li>
		<li>Fixed an incorrect “no NPC has [penis] in position [leftarm]” warning when both hands hold the same NPC.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed classroom masturbation and stripping checks</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Unavailable masturbation or stripping options now stay hidden during lessons instead of causing an error.</li>
		<li>Blackmail quest stage 4 can still override this as before.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Ocean Breeze Oral</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Breeder and Omega characters no longer climax unexpectedly without semen inside where the scene should not allow it.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Whitney events</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Fixed an event using the wrong pronoun.</li>
		<li>The player can no longer visit Whitney's flat while Whitney is too angry with them.</li>
		<li>Whitney's X-Change encounter now uses the correct alley or school location instead of stale location data.</li>
		<li>Expanded Whitney's X-Change bluff story.</li>
		<li>Restored the missing freeze response.</li>
		<li>Anxiety and Panic can now force the freeze response.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Crossdresser and Gender-Anxious traits</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Both traits now use the player's <strong>original sex</strong> instead of their current X-Changed body.</li>
		<li>Gender-flipping no longer reverses their Gender Identity, Stress, changing-room, doctor-clothing, or trait-description effects.</li>
		<li>Corrected identity modifiers for characters who started male.</li>
		<li>NPC reactions still use the player's current body as usual.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Dragon Eyes and beast content settings</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Dragon Eyes still causes its normal hallucination effects.</li>
		<li>It no longer forces farm animals or other beast encounters into monster-person forms merely because hallucinations are active.</li>
		<li>Explicit monster-person settings and forced monster forms still work.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed combat speech and clothing transparency</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Corrected named-NPC speech handling.</li>
		<li>Fixed clothing transparency issues in combat.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed missing icons, hairstyles, dysphoria text, bike passage, fishing, and Wraith errors</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed several reported bugs</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Swarm photos now correctly say that <strong>you</strong> are climaxing instead of referring to the player's face or genitals.</li>
		<li>Fixed Wren/Gwylan heist mix-ups between the bank robbery and painting heist.</li>
		<li>X-Change school hallway events now share a <strong>one event per day</strong> limit.</li>
		<li>Fixed the <strong>NPC makeup interference</strong> setting frequency and clarified its tooltip.</li>
		<li>Gwylan no longer requests incompatible outfits together or clothes from his own shop.</li>
		<li>Avery's drinks cabinet now stops after six drinks, or sooner if the player becomes too drunk to pour another.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed full-body and high-resolution sprite rendering</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>High-resolution image packs now render at their intended quality instead of first being reduced to standard sprite resolution.</li>
		<li>Standard sprites and normal image packs are unaffected.</li>
		<li>Fixed lighting layers becoming misaligned in the shop, hairdresser, and mirror when using the enlarged side-view canvas.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed img2 clothing icon fallback</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>If an <code>img2</code> clothing icon is missing, the game now falls back to the matching icon from the main <code>img</code> folder.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed code typos and brawling masturbation ending</strong>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added matching trait flavour text</strong>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Hyperactive Mammaries</strong> now describes its unnatural milk capacity.</li>
		<li><strong>Hyperactive Prostate</strong> now describes its larger reserve.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon images" aria-hidden="true">&#10024;</span> Art and Graphics</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Added milk machine prop for Mysterious</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>By Ognjen.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Mysterious graphics by snowy</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Fixed regular-shirt bound-arm sprites being misaligned.</li>
		<li>Added a celestial halo for doggy position.</li>
		<li>Edited tentacle sprites.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added NNPC pack by RazzPixel</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added new portraits for Bailey, Briar, Charlie, Darryl, Harper, Landry, Leighton, Mason, Morgan, Night Monster, Quinn, Riley, River, and Sirris.</li>
		<li>Includes multiple female, male, monster, dark, and pale variants depending on the character.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Aoki Utage Fem faces</strong>
		</li>
		</ul>

	</div>
<</widget>>
